WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.240
I ride Dreadmaster from Hagakure!

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.380
That's the end of my turn-degozaru!

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.490
"Degozaru"? What the heck is that?

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:09.850
Final Turn!

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:10.890
Whaaat?!

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.870
You only say that at the very end!

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:15.430
Huh? Is that right?

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:16.770
You're still a greenhorn...

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:19.460
What's wrong, Brother Aichi?

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.150
Oh, Kamui.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:24.780
Ah, I was just thinking that the 
Shop Tournament is over already...

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:26.940
Okay, this time, Final Turn!

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:30.560
W-What?! The prey becomes 
the predator-degozaru?!

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.590
Final Turn...

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:35.650
You do not give up the 
fight, I'll give you that.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.240
But this is as far as you'll go.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:45.610
Darn it! My only regret is not 
being able to take down Kai!

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:50.270
I had a good time. It didn't matter 
to me whether I won or lost.

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:51.070
But...

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:54.230
But... it's frustrating when 
you <i>do</i> lose, isn't it...

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:55.570
...in a Vanguard fight?

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.530
I wanna get stronger.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:03.300
In that case, there's nothing for it but 
to go to other shops to improve your game!

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.760
But I don't know any other shops...

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:12.040
Leave it to me, Brother Aichi!

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:13.530
I know a good shop!

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:15.430
Really?! And you'll take me there?

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:16.550
Of course!

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:21.210
It's called "Card Shop Handsome", and 
it's a hangout for strong players...

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.980
Come to think of it, that's where <i>she</i> is!

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.420
But I already promised Brother...

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:05.520
Ah! Miss Emi...

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:14.580
Totally Opposed

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:07.550
Don't do it! Don't go, Kamui!

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:09.930
If you see <i>her</i> there, who 
knows what could happen?!

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:13.080
You need spiritual meditation! 
Act with the utmost caution here!

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:14.440
"Spearmint au gratin"?

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:17.690
Oh, cut it out! "Never 
look back", I always say!

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.250
Forward, Forward, Ever Forward!!

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:19.930
Think of it like this!

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:24.960
You can put Brother Aichi in your debt! "If you 
want to shoot the general, first shoot his horse."

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:27.170
In this case, the "general" is Miss Emi?

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:31.560
Kamui, you're so dependable! You're 
the only possible groom for Emi!

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.020
Kamui?

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:38.710
That's right! Besides, it's not 
like she's <i>always</i> in the shop!

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:41.800
In fact, I bet she's not there 
today! I've got a good feeling!

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.700
Let's go, Brother Aichi!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.170
You can depend on the groom!

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:50.990
Come on!

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:52.150
S-Sure.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.950
Oh, that's right. Misaki!

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:54.560
Yeah?

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:58.540
Do you know what "spearmint au 
gratin" or "vessel medication" mean?

00:03:58.540 --> 00:03:59.590
Hah?

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:02.400
Ah, never mind! We're off, Brother!

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:03.320
O-Okay!

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:06.730
Spearmint au gratin...

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:08.230
Vessel medication...

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.440
Oh. "Spiritual meditation", I bet.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:13.940
Impossible for you.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:19.320
The Fearsome Undead! A Granblue Deck!

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:25.420
Kamui, you said there were strong players 
at this shop we're going to, right?

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:27.190
Yes indeed, Brother Aichi!

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:30.920
They've got a team there that participated 
in the nationals last year.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:32.340
Nationals?

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:37.160
We were only chosen to 
represent Card Capital.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:40.240
All of the teams representing 
shops go to regional tournaments,

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:44.980
and, if they win there, they advance 
to the national tournament.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.950
By that stage, all the 
teams' levels are way high,

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:50.370
so advancing to the next 
round is no mean feat!

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.100
Oh, really?

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:55.400
Let's aim for the nationals!

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:58.350
Card Shop Handsome

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:01.820
The winners of last year's regional 
tournament are in here...

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:11.160
Hey, Kamui, is that you?

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:12.910
Long time no see, dude!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.910
Shhh!

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.780
Looks like the coast is clear.

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:24.210
This is the place, Brother Aichi.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.150
Is Gouki in?

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:27.370
Naturally.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:29.670
Captain, Kamui's here!

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:30.760
Captain?

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:37.460
These guys are the team that 
went to the nationals last year.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.800
They're called "Team Handsome".

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:45.690
That's the team we gotta 
beat at the regionals.

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:47.750
Team Handsome...

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:53.850
Well, if it ain't Kamui! Been a 
long time! How you doin', man?!

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:56.000
I'm doin' fine, of course, Gouki!

00:05:57.970 --> 00:05:58.780
Hm?

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:02.800
Kamui, this is the first time 
you've brought somebody over.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:06.040
N-Nice to meet you. I'm Aichi Sendou.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:08.340
Kamui has been a huge help to me.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:11.590
Is that so? I'm Gouki Daimonji.

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:13.070
Hiroshi Nakatsugawa.

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:14.630
He's Kaoru Komatsubara.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:15.760
Good to know ya!

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:17.080
Good to know ya!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.120
I-It's good to know you.

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:22.410
By the way, Kamui...

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:26.290
Have you given any more thought to 
becomin' a member of Team Handsome?

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.050
Huh?!

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:30.100
How many times do I have to refuse?!

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:34.830
Brother Aichi here and I are both 
representatives of Card Capital!

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:38.380
And we're gonna beat you guys 
at the next regional tournament!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:43.680
Sorry to hear that. Ya got real talent, man.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:45.910
Kamui, is this all true?

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:46.740
Yes.

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:50.080
Then why...? Their team went 
to the national tournament.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:55.470
The idea isn't to buddy up with strong 
players, but to fight against 'em!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.310
Sounds cool, if only it were true.

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:02.520
We both know that's not 
the real reason! Kaboom!

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:04.620
What do they mean?

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:08.910
Kamui!!

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:14.570
I love you, Kamui!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.850
Oh, she's the one!

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:24.930
That's right! Now that I'm in 
4th grade, we can get married!

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:30.420
Note: 4th graders cannot get married.

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:28.210
As if! I mean, you're not even 
my girlfriend! Get away from me!

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:29.430
Kamui!!

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:30.880
Get offa me!

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:34.550
Could she be the reason he 
hasn't joined Team Handsome?

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:38.300
Bingo! Kamui has a hard 
time dealing with Nagisa.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.280
Kaboom!

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:44.410
Yep. Maul him all you want, little sis!

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:45.190
Little sister?

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:48.320
Nagisa's my baby sister. Cute, isn't she?

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.020
Yeah...

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:50.190
You got a little sister?

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:51.330
Y-Yes...

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:52.990
You an' me are in the same boat?!

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:56.050
Then you understand. A guy lets his 
little sister get away with anything.

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:57.380
Am I right?

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:58.600
Well, uh, sure...

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:02.480
I'll do anything to keep my sister smilin'!

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:05.990
And anyone who makes my sister 
unhappy is gonna feel my wrath!

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.620
Get offa me, I said!

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:11.150
No way! I haven't seen you in ages, Kamui!

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:14.680
Oh yeah?! Then I'll take this 
opportunity to make myself clear!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.300
I'm not in love with you!

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:21.060
Kamui...

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:23.360
I can't hear you!

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:25.310
My head hurts...

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:27.400
Nagisa!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.790
I can't hear you! I can't hear you!

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:30.780
Nagisa...

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:31.750
Yes?!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:33.050
You could hear me!

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:37.450
Listen to me! The person 
I'm in love with is...

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:38.580
Nagisa!

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:43.840
No! The one I'm in love with is 
pretty, clean, and has a cute smile!

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:48.260
Unlike you, she isn't rude or pushy, 
and she listens when a guy talks!

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.660
I'm in love with somebody!

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:51.610
That's me!

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:52.860
Somebody else!

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:57.480
Brother, give him back! Kamui is mine!

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:58.780
Ouch!

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:01.540
Kamui, were you telling the truth?!

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:05.600
Yeah, it's true! I don't love 
Nagisa! There's somebody else!

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.750
Say it again!

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:09.040
The one I love...

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:12.670
...is Brother Aichi's l-li-lit...

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:14.740
Huh?! Don't tell me you...?!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.620
You fell in love with this guy?!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:17.030
Eh?!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.370
What?!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.350
Argh!

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.200
I don't believe it...

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.710
You've got the wrong idea!

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:25.140
It's not Brother Aichi, 
it's...M-Miss...E...mi...

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:26.580
No way is this gonna stand.

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:31.290
I said, it's not what you think!

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:32.800
Kamui!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:36.140
Anyone who makes my sister 
unhappy feels my wrath.

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:41.970
I respect Kamui's talent and he respects 
you enough to call you "Brother".

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:45.740
So you must be one hell 
of a Vanguard Fighter.

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:47.400
N-Not really...

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:51.110
Oh, I'm pretty convinced. My gut 
feelin' never steers me wrong.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:53.900
So, fight me!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.610
If you lose, Nagisa gets Kamui!

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.820
And you gotta give up Kamui cold turkey.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.350
Huh? I don't know what you mean!

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:06.310
I don't know why everyone's 
got the wrong idea!

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:08.870
Kamui, you like boys?

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:10.730
Noooo!

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:21.050
Please be careful, Brother Aichi!

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:25.160
Gouki's Granblue deck has 
a ferocious strategy that... {it is Granblue like in the episode title, or Granblue like here??}

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.950
There's no need for words 
in a fight between men!

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:30.540
Thank you, Kamui.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:33.760
But I want to take this 
chance to fight alone,

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:36.570
with my own ability, as a kind 
of tournament simulation.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:41.540
Brother Aichi, please win for my sake!

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:44.160
Watch quietly, Nagisa!

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:48.150
Pfft! If we have to do this, 
why couldn't I fight Kamui?!

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:49.560
Reason aside,

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:52.570
I have the opportunity to play against 
someone who made it to the national tournament.

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:53.590
I'll do my best!

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:57.750
I'm not lettin' anyone stand 
in the way of my sister's love!

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.330
Here I go!

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:09.800
Stand up! Vanguard!

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.030
Barcgal!

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.740
Guiding Zombie!

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:30.370
This is the first time I've seen 
this unit... A Granblue deck, huh? {Granblue or Granblue?}

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.620
Scared as I am, I'm looking 
forward to this just as much!

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:35.240
You start, home-wrecker!

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:36.090
Home-wrecker...?

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.560
I ride Wingal!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:43.310
Barcgal uses its ability to 
move to a rear-guard circle!

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:47.730
Then Barcgal uses its skill 
to call Flogal from the deck!

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:55.150
That's the end of my turn.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:56.850
Ready?!

00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:00.030
I ride Dandy Guy, Romario!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:06.580
Next, I use Guiding 
Zombie's skill to move it!

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:08.240
The same skill as Barcgal...

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:11.540
And then I call Dancing Cutlass!

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:16.690
Cutlass boosts Guiding Zombie...

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:18.900
...and attacks your Wingal!

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:25.690
Damage trigger check!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.350
Romario attacks Wingal!

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:37.860
Drive trigger check!

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:41.850
Damage trigger check!

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:45.140
Got a heal trigger!

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:47.390
Wingal's power rises by 5000!

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:50.300
I restore 1 damage.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:53.620
I stand and draw.

00:12:57.140 --> 00:13:00.370
Stand up, my avatar!

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:01.920
Blaster Blade!

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.220
I move Flogal forward.

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:12.300
Then I call the Knight of Rose, Morgana, 
and two of the Little Sage, Marron!

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:18.060
I attack your Romario with 
my Flogal, boosted by Marron!

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:23.950
Damage trigger check!

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:30.410
I continue with Blaster 
Blade, boosted by Barcgal!

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:33.700
Drive trigger check!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.980
Damage trigger check!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:43.780
One more! Morgana, boosted by Marron!

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:47.230
I guard with Chappie the Ghostie!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:57.190
I'm using Chappie's skill to take 
Captain Nightmist from the deck...

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.810
...and put him in the Drop Zone!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:03.320
Huh? He doesn't use a precious 
unit, but drops it...?

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.310
My turn's over.

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:10.570
What he's gotta watch out for 
with Gouki's Granblue deck...

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.740
...is that Drop Zone.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:16.130
I stand and draw!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.720
I ride Captain Nightmist!

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:23.920
I activate a skill!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.790
When Captain Nightmist is 
in the Vanguard Circle...

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:29.840
...if there's another Nightmist 
in the Drop Zone...

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:33.800
...the one in the Vanguard Circle 
gets +3000 during my turn!

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:36.930
I see! That last turn was for this!

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:41.930
I thought he was a powerful player, 
but his deck is finely calculated!

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:46.280
Brother...

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:49.200
I stand and draw!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.700
Enter the fray, ruler of all knights!

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.700
I ride King of Knights, Alfred!

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:03.460
Whoa...

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:09.130
I'm putting Flogal in the Drop Zone and 
calling the Knight of Silence, Gallatin!

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:16.590
Then I attack your Nightmist with 
Gallatin, boosted by Marron!

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:22.700
Damage trigger check!

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.830
Got a trigger!

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:27.330
+5000 to Nightmist's power!

00:15:29.230 --> 00:15:33.070
Alfred! Show me the united 
power of the Royal Paladins!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:37.910
I attack Nightmist!

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:42.060
Twin drive!

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:47.830
Damage trigger check!

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:53.980
I attack with Morgana, boosted by Marron!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.130
I guard with Ruin Shade!

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:07.240
Android that transcends life and death...

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:09.500
Show me your unearthly power!

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:10.530
Ride!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:19.040
I replace Guiding Zombie with Cutlass!

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:24.510
I resurrect Captain Nightmist!

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:29.900
Pirates can be resurrected 
any number of times.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:32.420
From the Drop Zone with a Counterblast?

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:38.560
Tch! Here it comes at last, 
Gouki's killer pattern...

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:41.130
Infinite Resurrection Hell!

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:46.190
If he activates that maneuver, 
there's no escape!

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:50.140
And now, the coup de grace of the Granblue.

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:55.250
I attack Alfred with Monster 
Frank, boosted by Evil Shade!

00:16:57.600 --> 00:17:00.120
I activate Evil Shade's skill!

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:07.960
Evil Shade's skill gives 
Monster Frank +4000 power!

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:15.560
I don't defend...

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:17.040
Twin drive!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:22.680
Damage trigger check!

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:26.670
Nightmist, boosted by Guiding Zombie!

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:30.400
Blueblood!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.650
I defend with Baron!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:38.770
Incredible. All of these actions 
are tied to the next turn...

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:40.760
This is it...

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:42.830
I have to attack and finish 
him off this turn...

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:44.680
Here I go!

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:45.690
I'm gonna draw!

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:49.440
I attack with Morgana, boosted by Marron!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.450
Morgana's skill!

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:56.090
If I drop one card from my hand, she gets 
+4000 power until the end of the turn!

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:58.720
No guard!

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:02.310
Damage trigger check!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.290
Alfred, it's in your hands!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.360
I defend with Gust Jinn!

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:14.190
And on top of that, the Jinn's skill: 
I drop a card to nullify your attack!

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:18.140
But I still have the twin drive!

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.030
I got a critical trigger!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.640
Gallatin gets +5000 power,

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:29.410
and +1 damage! I attack 
with Marron's boost!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:33.210
I guard with Cutlass and Rune Shade!

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.170
That uses up the last of my hand...

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.640
Yes! If this attack works...

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.960
You forgot about intercept!

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:44.110
I intercept with Nightmist!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:54.350
It's a successful defense!

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:58.150
Oh, no... He prevented a 
full-strength attack...

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:00.240
Guess this is it...

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:08.580
My turn is over.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.440
You ain't givin' up yet?

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:11.220
No.

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:15.360
You lost Nightmist and you don't 
have any cards in your hand.

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:18.130
As it stands, attacking me is a tall order.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:22.240
You defended against me, so likewise, 
there's a possibility I can defend against you.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:26.010
That's Brother Aichi for you! 
He doesn't know when to quit!

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:28.550
I only wish I could mean 
that as a compliment...

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:32.140
This fight was over the moment I held on.

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:32.780
Huh?

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:35.570
I stand and draw!

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:37.060
I call Jinn!

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:40.760
Like I was sayin', pirates can 
regenerate any number of times!

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:42.570
Captain Nightmist!

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:44.160
Counterblast!

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:48.980
Resurrection!

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:50.910
Using Counterblast again...?!

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:54.630
Blueblood attacks Alfred!

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:56.930
I defend with Morgana!

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:03.470
Two more times...

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:05.600
This is it!

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:11.280
Everything is sacrificed to the Malevolent 
Soul of the Immortal God of Destruction!

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:14.150
Monster Frank, boosted by Evil Shade...

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.380
...attacks Alfred!

00:20:17.260 --> 00:20:19.690
Also, I activate Evil Shade's skill!

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:22.950
+4000 power to Monster Frank!

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:26.660
I defend with Future Knight Llew and Wingal!

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:33.730
Twin drive check!

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:34.710
First check...

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:36.570
Second check...

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.720
Critical trigger!

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:43.900
+5000 power to Monster Frank!

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:51.940
My only chance rides on this 
damage trigger check...

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:05.950
I lose.

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:17.520
That's right! That's right! I'm the Captain!

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:18.670
I was crushed.

00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:24.100
That's the level of a Vanguard Fighter 
who makes it to the national tournament.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:27.070
I wanna become like him...

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:30.500
No, even stronger than him!

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:33.350
You're as strong as ever, Gouki...

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:35.340
That's my big brother!

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:38.050
And now, Kamui belongs to Nagisa!

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:39.860
So you stay away from him!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:43.320
Uh, Kamui and I aren't like that...

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:46.280
I'm trying to tell you, you 
jumped to the wrong conclusion!

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:50.300
Then Kamui does love me!

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:51.460
Mm-hm!

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:57.680
Looks like the Card Capital kids aren't 
gonna pose any problems this year either!

00:21:57.680 --> 00:22:01.710
Nothin' to be afraid of! Kabooom!

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:06.230
What?! I swear we'll beat you guys 
at the regionals! We'll beat you!

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:07.320
Mm-hm.

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:10.260
How cool! Good luck, Kamui!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.390
Th-Thanks...

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:15.400
I love you, Kamui!

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:16.670
Kamui!

00:22:16.670 --> 00:22:19.060
Aiiiieeeee!

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:52.590
That was amazing, wasn't it, Kamui?

00:23:52.590 --> 00:23:56.620
Sure was. I felt like I was a boat 
thrown into a raging hurricane!

00:23:56.620 --> 00:24:00.920
Yeah, what was that Unit that kept 
resurrecting? Infinite Swirling Current...?

00:24:00.920 --> 00:24:01.400
Eh?

00:24:01.400 --> 00:24:02.510
Oh.

00:24:02.510 --> 00:24:07.130
Anyway, that Nagisa is cute, 
but she was also powerful.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:09.610
I don't care, I'm intent on Miss Emi!

00:24:09.610 --> 00:24:12.680
Next time: Thrilling?! Emi's First Fight!

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:14.800
Go easy on her, Morikawa...

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:17.560
Eh?! What?! Oh, no! Why him?!

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:19.170
That was my dream...!
